  "details": "Currently the only transform that can have physbone parameters is the root transform.  For example if physbone effects two transforms there isn't a way to get the angle for both of them.  In order to get this, you have to add individual physbone components to each transform.  \nAdding support for physbone will allow supporting more detailed parameters for they dynamic bones.\nA couple possible ideas, adding an index to the generated variable names so each transform has its own parameter automatically.  Another possible idea is being able to add that pulls out the physbone data affecting the specific transform and export to parameters.",
